{
  "bodyHash": "I2mQxp3coZo=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">絲滑觸摸擴展了絲綢之觸附魔的功能。每個功能都可以在配置中開啟或關閉。你將能夠拾取生怪磚、龍蛋、蛋糕（未被食用過的）、被感染的石頭等物品！<br><br>請在下方配置設定中查看完整功能列表。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於原版體驗整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableDragonEggDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">使用絲綢之觸鎬子時，禁用龍蛋的傳送功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSpawnerDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，生怪磚可透過絲綢之觸掉落，並保留其生怪資料。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrialSpawnerDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">降低試煉生怪磚的「強度」以允許破壞它。使用絲綢之觸鎬子可將其掉落。更改此項需要重啟遊戲。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFullCakeDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許未被食用過的蛋糕以絲綢之觸掉落。也適用於插蠟蛋糕。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableBuddedAmethystDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許紫水晶芽床被絲綢之觸挖掘時掉落。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFarmlandDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許耕地被絲綢之觸收割時掉落。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTallGrassDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許高草叢被絲綢之觸收割時掉落。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSnowLayerDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許雪層被絲綢之觸收割時掉落。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableVinesDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許藤蔓被絲綢之觸收割時掉落。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableInfestedStoneDrop</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設為 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允許被感染的石頭被絲綢之觸挖掘時掉落。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下物品皆以絲綢之觸附魔挖掘：</span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>生怪磚：</strong><br><em>試煉生怪磚預設為停用：</em></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蛋糕（有無蠟燭皆可）與雪層：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>龍蛋不會傳送：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事宜，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
